(text "NT1 is a copper net-tie: all grounds meet only at this planned power-entry star." (at 15 15.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid d57da16c-34eb-5c5b-8bfc-d6faf5159f42))
(text "PGND1..6 are separate motor return branches. Do not join through Mini control sockets." (at 15 18.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 436295e1-0b18-5f49-b68b-9e1069d9f70d))
(text "Touch returns have their own branch plus one ferrite bead each, away from motor current." (at 15 21.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 908c76d4-5911-5fb6-907c-dfb258ef8010))
(text "I2C expansion is 3.3V only; 4.7k pullups. No daughterboard motor power on this connector." (at 15 24.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid ab7d8ba0-d7cf-5883-a488-ac19015692f3))
(text "Star is beside input; buck return is routed. Motor, wrist and touch branches remain open." (at 15 28.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid fdeb3a0b-a7cc-55d0-b2d3-b0b5e8197b17))
